+-- Additive: EVENT-scoped public footer links via NavItem (custom footer editor).
+-- FOOTER is EVENT-only in application code; SITE continues to use
+-- FOOTER_LEGAL / FOOTER_EVENTS for the homepage directory columns.
+--
+-- Nothing is renamed, dropped, or reordered. Postgres allows
+-- ALTER TYPE ... ADD VALUE inside a transaction as long as the new value is
+-- not used in the same transaction — this migration only declares it.
+-- IF NOT EXISTS keeps the migration safe to re-run against a database where
+-- the value was already applied out of band.
+
+ALTER TYPE "NavPlacement" ADD VALUE IF NOT EXISTS 'FOOTER';
